@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Packet Routing Workflow

start

:Create or load network topology;
:Add devices;
:Connect devices with weighted links;

:Create packet;
:Select routing algorithm;

if (Source and destination exist?) then (yes)
    :Calculate route using DijkstraRouting;
else (no)
    :Throw error;
    stop
endif

if (Route found?) then (yes)
    :Start packet transmission;
else (no)
    :Report missing route;
    stop
endif

while (Next hop exists and TTL > 0?) is (yes)
    :Move packet to next device;
    :Decrease TTL;
    :Add hop to packet history;
    :Add link cost to total time;
endwhile (no)

if (Packet reached destination?) then (yes)
    :Report successful delivery;
else (no)
    :Report incomplete delivery or TTL expiration;
endif

stop

@enduml
